    "en": "Wilson Revolve Spin 16 is a pentagonal co-polyester string featuring a low-friction UHMW additive and Crosslink Ester Polymer construction. Designed for aggressive players, it combines exceptional ball bite, heavy spin and excellent tension maintenance while maintaining a crisp, connected response.",

    "zh": "Wilson Revolve Spin 16 是一款五角形聚酯球线，采用 UHMW 低摩擦材料和 Crosslink Ester Polymer 配方。它专为现代底线重上旋打法设计，能够提供极高的 Ball Bite、Spin 与优秀的保磅表现，同时保持清晰且稳定的击球反馈。"
  },

